<th background-color="light-gray">半恢复(种子0)</th>
<th background-color="light-gray">蠕变段稳态 RMS</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>0.001× (过小)</td>
<td>64–77 s(阶跃后 16–29 s)</td>
<td>14.6 s</td>
<td>旋转 1.33° / 平移 1.14 cm</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>1× (匹配)</td>
<td>61–65 s(阶跃后 13–17 s)</td>
<td><b>8.9 s</b></td>
